   527	   Fable: shape first (M1, M2), memory last, because the node treats state digests as opaque
   528	   and the current chain work continues meanwhile.
   529	   Astra: memory and the native Compact probe early, because they decide whether the
   530	   architecture stands; do not freeze a GP interface on the current chain.
   531	   Section 4 keeps the Fable order for building and takes Astra's for measuring: experiments 3
   532	   and 5 run before M2 starts.
