   553	  absorption additions come on top; per Astra `MC:hash/poseidon/poseidon_chip.rs:430-536`,
   554	  not re-derived by the editor). The per-access totals are withdrawn.
   555	- **"Challenge-based memory cannot compose"** was too strong.
