   557	  copied subgraphs). `shape_d` added.
   558	- **Accepted roots do not prevent replay.** Claim-level set added.
   559	- **`openClaim` with an unbounded path** is not a Compact circuit. Bounded path with sub-root
   560	  opening.
   561	- **Seal** needs an opening of `post_d` and an empty-dependency condition; R needs a one-leaf
   562	  mode.
   563	- **State inventory** missed the helper task stack and three of the four append tables;
   564	  structured results need a canonical digest, not a root and a handle.
   565	- **Row intervals for N, R, F** are hypotheses; "decider time unchanged" was unsupported; the
   566	  proof count omitted seals; ideal worker scaling contradicts the recorded f3.
   567	- **Folding**: "needs a KZG opening of the folded witness" was too strong.
   568	- **"Cannot be met"** for two prior proofs plus new work was wrong as an impossibility; it is a
